title: 构造与工厂
tags: 竞技场咏唱设计模式 AI生成

!! 工厂模式在咏唱中的作用

工厂根据能量来源和装备创建等价的可签名咏唱对象。同一接口下的不同来源分支主要用于产生不同工厂签名，证明玩家通过工厂方法组织了构造路径。

!! 核心接口

```ts
export interface ChantFactory {
  createBinder(codex: ChantCodex): ChantBinder;
  createPipeline(context: ChantContext): ChantPipeline;
}

export interface ChantBinder {
  bind(input: ChantMaterial): Promise<BoundVerse>;
}
```

!! 具体工厂

蜂解石工厂：

```ts
export class HexstoneChantFactory implements ChantFactory {
  createBinder(codex: ChantCodex): ChantBinder {
    return new HexstoneBinder(codex.hexstone, codex.lattice);
  }

  createPipeline(context: ChantContext): ChantPipeline {
    return new StandardChantPipeline([
      new NormalizeFragmentStep(),
      new FoldHexstoneStep(),
      new SealLineageStep(),
    ], context);
  }
}
```

祈愿力工厂：

```ts
export class PrayerChantFactory implements ChantFactory {
  createBinder(codex: ChantCodex): ChantBinder {
    return new PrayerBinder(codex.prayer, codex.archive);
  }

  createPipeline(context: ChantContext): ChantPipeline {
    return new StandardChantPipeline([
      new EchoPrayerStep(),
      new BindIndexRangeStep(),
      new SealLineageStep(),
    ], context);
  }
}
```

遗物工厂：

```ts
export class ArtifactChantFactory implements ChantFactory {
  constructor(private artifact: EquippedArtifact) {}

  createBinder(codex: ChantCodex): ChantBinder {
    return new ArtifactBinder(codex.artifact, this.artifact);
  }

  createPipeline(context: ChantContext): ChantPipeline {
    return new StandardChantPipeline([
      new AttuneArtifactStep(this.artifact),
      new FoldHexstoneStep(),
      new SealLineageStep(),
    ], context);
  }
}
```

