!! 建造者模式

用于逐步装配复杂咏唱证明：

```ts
export class ChantProofBuilder {
  private route?: ChantRoute;
  private eventKeys: EventKey[] = [];
  private pipelineTrace?: PipelineTrace[];
  private commandTrace?: ChantCommandTrace[];
  private stateTrace?: StateTransitionTrace[];

  withRoute(route: ChantRoute): this {
    this.route = route;
    return this;
  }

  withEventKeys(keys: EventKey[]): this {
    this.eventKeys = keys;
    return this;
  }

  withPipelineTrace(trace: PipelineTrace[]): this {
    this.pipelineTrace = trace;
    return this;
  }

  async seal(sealApi: SealApi): Promise<ChantProof> {
    return sealApi.finalize({
      route: this.route,
      eventKeys: this.eventKeys,
      pipelineTrace: this.pipelineTrace,
      commandTrace: this.commandTrace,
      stateTrace: this.stateTrace,
    });
  }
}
```

!! 使用示例

```ts
const factory = selectFactory(params.preferredSource, context.equipment);
const binder = factory.createBinder(context.codex);
const pipeline = factory.createPipeline(context);

const bound = await binder.bind(material);
const piped = await pipeline.run(bound);

const proof = await new ChantProofBuilder()
  .withRoute(route)
  .withEventKeys(eventKeys)
  .withPipelineTrace(piped.trace)
  .seal(context.codex.seal);
```

!! 与技能触发的关系

工厂水印参与配方匹配。不同工厂来源返回的对象可以具有等价功能结果，配方检查的是构造来源和签名序列。例如：

```ts
{
  id: 'increaseRange',
  sequence: ['factoryMethod', 'pipeline', 'pipeline', 'decorator'],
  constraints: {
    distinctFactorySources: true,
  },
}
```

要求工厂来源为`hexstonePower`或`prayerPower`，以证明玩家使用过指定来源的构造分支。

